    "text": "At very high frequencies, the effective impedance of the given circuit will be _________<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/69ca3d22-50fe-464a-b42a-b977c119baf8-image.png\" style=\"width: 442px; height: 238px;\" />",
    "image": null
